27
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:36,480
That's something
I really admire about you.

28
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,400
You two are killing me!

29
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,440
Today

30
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:41,880
