37
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,360
Sha Yue'er.

38
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,000
I used to be so conflicted.

39
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,760
I wasn't sure what I really wanted.

40
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,160
