877
00:29:49,500 --> 00:29:50,660
You could never look bad.

878
00:29:52,940 --> 00:29:53,700
(Looks down)

879
00:29:55,340 --> 00:29:56,500
You could never look bad.

880
00:29:57,020 --> 00:29:58,900
How can you say that about yourself?

881
00:29:58,900 --> 00:29:59,580
That's just Cao Yiheng.

882
00:29:59,580 --> 00:30:00,740
Sometimes, the way he says things

883
00:30:00,740 --> 00:30:01,380
