1569
00:49:58,340 --> 00:49:59,020
I think so too.

1570
00:49:59,020 --> 00:50:00,780
Don't you think I look better in person?

1571
00:50:01,900 --> 00:50:03,580
(Making eye contact)

1572
00:50:05,900 --> 00:50:06,940
Actually, yeah.

1573
00:50:07,700 --> 00:50:08,540
He's happy.

1574
00:50:11,220 --> 00:50:12,820
