1575
00:50:12,860 --> 00:50:13,580
Okay.

1576
00:50:13,580 --> 00:50:16,060
Zhao Xilun and Sha Yue'er matched.

1577
00:50:16,220 --> 00:50:17,020
I got it right.

1578
00:50:17,020 --> 00:50:17,580
You did?

1579
00:50:17,580 --> 00:50:18,180
I got it right.

1580
00:50:18,180 --> 00:50:19,060
I'm amazing.

1581
00:50:19,060 --> 00:50:19,500
Jiang.

1582
00:50:19,500 --> 00:50:20,900
I got one-third

1583
00:50:20,900 --> 00:50:21,700
right.

1584
00:50:21,900 --> 00:50:22,820
Now it depends

1585
00:50:22,820 --> 00:50:23,500
