1657
00:52:47,900 --> 00:52:49,660
What a headache. What now?

1658
00:52:49,900 --> 00:52:50,980
Yeah, all of a sudden...

1659
00:52:51,220 --> 00:52:52,220
Chen Hewen's probably thinking,

1660
00:52:52,220 --> 00:52:52,980
I only have two cards.

1661
00:52:52,980 --> 00:52:53,940
Why is there another person now?

1662
00:52:53,940 --> 00:52:54,780
Yeah.

1663
00:52:55,060 --> 00:52:55,860
